ps://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"labeled","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2020-08-17T19:50:35Z","label":{"name":"area/docdb","color":"0c4fcc"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/675102066","html_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/5415#issuecomment-675102066","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/5415","id":675102066,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDY3NTEwMjA2Ng==","user":{"login":"ttyusupov","id":903044,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwMzA0NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/903044?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov","html_url":"https://github.com/ttyusupov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-08-17T20:38:56Z","updated_at":"2020-08-17T20:42:53Z","body":"The root cause is that `MetaCache::GetNearestSplitAncestorUnlocked` might work incorrectly when 2nd post-split tablet is already added into `table_data.tablets_by_partition`. Then the function is trying to use this tablet as an ancestor candidate, but it doesn't match (not strictly contains partition of itself). The function switches to searching ancestor inside `split_tablets`, but ancestor is really still in `tablets_by_partition`.\r\n\r\nThere are the following options on how to handle this correctly:\r\n1) We can instead continue to iterate back over all tablets inside `tablets_by_partition` by start partition key until we find an ancestor. In the worst case, it can have linear computational complexity.\r\n2) Store all tablets that are known to `MetaCache` inside a vector (by `split_depth`) of sorted maps (by partition start key) and use it to find the nearest split ancestor. It will have logarithmic computational complexity.\r\n3) Simplify client requests ID handling by removing the need to track nearest split ancestor and instead: \r\n    - When `MetaCache` knows about parent tablet (common scenario) - use its `request_id_seq` for post-split tablet.\r\n    - When `MetaCache` doesn't know about parent tablet - use `0` for post-split tablet, then on getting `request id is less than min` - use min request ID plus `2^24` (there wouldn't be `2^24` client requests in progress from the same client to the same tablet, so it is safe to do this).\r\n\r\nSolution 3) should be the simplest (less extra logic, less extra data, easier to understand, easier to update when we will need to support tablets merging) and performant for the common scenario with rare additional roundtrip from `YBClient` to `TServer` for fresh post-split tablets if `YBClient` doesn't know about their parent tablet.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/675102066/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"ttyusupov","id":903044,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwMzA0NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/903044?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov","html_url":"https://github.com/ttyusupov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":3799304525,"node_id":"MDE1OlJlZmVyZW5jZWRFdmVudDM3OTkzMDQ1MjU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/events/3799304525","actor":{"login":"ttyusupov","id":903044,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwMzA0NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/903044?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov","html_url":"https://github.com/ttyusupov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/repos","e